      "id": "tagore-stray-birds-s0113-p00114",
      "source_en": "Cheerless\nis the day, the light under frowning clouds is like a punished child with traces of tears on its pale cheeks, and the cry of the wind is like the cry of a wounded world. But I know I am travelling to meet my Friend.",
